                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", such as mobile data packages abroad, if the company phone tariff does not cover them"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Other necessary costs"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", such as visa fees, vaccinations required for the trip and trade fair entrance tickets"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The following expenses are not reimbursed:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Minibar, pay television, laundry and spa services at the hotel, unless the business trip lasts longer than seven days"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fines for traffic, parking or other offences"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Upgrades of flights, trains or rental cars without prior approval"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Costs for accompanying persons"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Tips exceeding 10 percent of the bill"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Lost or stolen personal items, which are covered by the group travel insurance"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "8. Submitting Your Expense Report"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Expense reports are submitted in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://example.com/finance/expenses"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "the expense tool"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " within four weeks after the end of the business trip. Please photograph or scan your receipts with the expense app and attach them to the report; original paper receipts must be kept for six months and handed to Finance on request. Hotel invoices must be addressed to [ORG_1], [ADDRESS_1]."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Open the approved travel request in the expense tool and select \"Create expense report\"."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Enter the actual departure and return times so that the meal allowance can be calculated."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Add each expense with the date, amount, currency and category, and attach the receipt."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "State any meals provided by third parties and any private extensions of the trip."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Submit the report. Your manager checks it within five working days, and Finance carries out a final review."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The reimbursement is paid with the next salary payment if the report is approved by the 15th of the month. Expenses paid with the company credit card are shown in the report automatically and only need to be supplemented with the receipts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "9. Travel Safety and Insurance"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[ORG_1] has taken out group travel insurance for all employees on business trips, including international health insurance, accident insurance and luggage insurance. The insurance documents and the emergency phone number are available in the expense tool. Before every trip outside the European Union, please register your trip in the travel safety portal so that the company can contact you in an emergency."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "10. Questions and Contact"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you have questions about this policy or about a specific business trip, please contact the travel management team in Finance at [EMAIL_1] or [PHONE_1]. Exceptions to this policy require the written approval of the head of Finance, [PERSON_1]."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
